===Format===
*All matches are played in a '''Bo1''' with 9 minute halves.

*'''Group Stage - ''From August 15th to 17th'''''
**16 players split into 2 groups of 8 players.
**Round Robin.
**<span class="bg-seedup">'''Top 3'''</span> from each group advance to [[Esports World Cup/2024/Playoffs|Playoffs]].
**<span class="bg-up">'''4-6'''</span> advance to [[Esports World Cup/2024/Resurrection Stage|Resurrection Stage]].
**'''7-8''' eliminated.

*'''Resurrection Stage - ''August 17th'''''
**6 players.
**Double Elimination Bracket.
**<span class="bg-up">'''Top 2'''</span> advance to [[Esports World Cup/2024/Playoffs|Playoffs]].

*'''Playoffs - ''August 18th'''''
**8 players.
** Single Elimination Bracket.

